Package: camera-engine-rkaiq-rk3588
Architecture: arm64
Provides: camera-engine-rkaiq
Conflicts: camera-engine-rkaiq, camera-engine-rkaiq-rk356x
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Rockchip ISP tuning and 3A engine for RK3588
 rkaiq is the userspace half of the Rockchip ISP: it drives auto exposure,
 auto white balance and auto focus, and applies the per-sensor tuning that
 turns raw sensor output into a usable image. rkaiq_3A_server is the daemon
 that does it, and /etc/iqfiles holds the tuning.
 .
 This package contains the RK3588 build, ISP hardware version 30.

